CHANGELOG.md
.codex/
.opencode/package.json
client/assets/
# oxfmt 0.59 re-flows markdown tables and breaks cells containing pipes inside
# code spans; keep long-form docs prose out of the formatter.
docs/
# sdd-runner materializes/edits these per round: agent-authored proposal/design
# prose with D1/D2 decomposition tables, plus review.md carrying verbatim gap
# quotes from those tables. oxfmt pads the tables and collapses whitespace
# inside the verbatim quotes (e.g. "index.ts      — barrel" -> "index.ts —"),
# corrupting the source-of-truth quote. Regenerated each round anyway.
openspec/changes/
# sdd-runner test scratch files (agent sidecar artifacts written to CWD by
# fake spawn functions during bun test; cleaned per-test but may persist
# into the format:check phase of check:full).
/findings-*.json
/resolutions-*.json
/findings-skeptic-*.json
/depth.json
/draft-*.json
/atomicity.json
/decompose-tasks.json
